msgid "Listening"
msgstr "ᱟᱧᱡᱚᱢᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ"

#: src/indicator/mod.rs:86
msgid "Transcribing"
msgstr "ᱴᱨᱟᱱᱥᱠᱨᱟᱭᱤᱵᱷᱤᱝ"

#: src/indicator/mod.rs:87
